  "original_chain": [
    "kya mounts Section dialog kg with nd and Tya. Tya mounts Aya after sections load.",
    "Aya forwards its Enter handler through identity _v/hEe and Qo to input.",
    "kg -> hv -> Bjt -> _3i -> Vrs -> SZ. Vrs enables Escape only without nested open dialogs.",
    "JSe stores SZ floating props, Rde reads popupProps and passes them into Es.",
    "SZ also registers native keydown/compositionstart/compositionend on Gl(m), the floating element ownerDocument or document.",
    "SZ composition ref P starts false. Start clears prior timer then sets true. End schedules false after yD?5:0 milliseconds. Cleanup removes listeners and clears timer.",
    "bS uses clearTimeout/setTimeout with sentinel0. yD tests CSS support for -webkit-backdrop-filter:none.",
    "While P.current is true, SZ Escape returns without requesting close or preventing the default.",
    "nd primary action -> Qh import ca -> TQt -> nh effective override or default -> Hfe/_Ut. Aya Enter guards nativeEvent.isComposing independently."
  ],
  "current_chain": [
    "SectionDialog -> shared Modal. Input Enter is composition-guarded and stops propagation when submitting.",
    "Modal closes on bubbled Escape without composition state. No matching Section or Modal composition start/end handlers exist.",
    "Window capture leaves bare Escape to bubble; it does not stop the local Modal callback."
  ],
  "intentional_divergence": "No intentional composition divergence documented in bounded introduction66a892af and SectionDialog/Dialogs change history. Ledger reconciliation pending. This is not exhaustive policy absence.",
  "nondefects": [
    "Local Enter is guarded in both sources.",
    "No unconditional prior-defaultPrevented contract is established; no such fix is proposed."
  ],
  "proposed_scope": "Reserved SectionDialog only, new independent regression, preserve all eight frozen files. Product correction waits for hosted regression failure.",
